CoCo Control Hub & Chargeback
=============================

This solution is built on the Cortex Code credit-manager ("CoCo Control Hub")
Quickstart application authored by Ram Chandrasekaran (Snowflake), distributed
via the public Snowflake-Labs/sfquickstarts repository.

The base application (governance, observability, and credit management for
Cortex Code) is that Quickstart. The chargeback and attribution capabilities —
the guided bill-generation flow, the attribution waterfall and unattributed
queue, cost tagging and read-only tag sync, warehouse-compute attribution, and
the PDF/CSV invoice/showback export — were added on top in this repository.

Attribution and credit for the base Control Hub application remain with the
original author. This repository packages the base app together with the
chargeback layer as a single, dedicated solution.
